Change(genesis='66602cd0dec37d58d03eec9518ca805a7ac38ea912d2b0c366a0b67b4b9f50b6', deps=('3bd9bcbb7e577683b5495ce2ebb8bc5930a148179fcf95662db235124371db78',), event=Revised(decision='codingsession', at=datetime(2026, 10, 28, 8, 45, 45, 948869), actor='assistant', title="A coding session is the owner's tap, and the routine's brief is the fence", body='⚠️ *A coding session is the owner\'s tap, and the routine\'s brief is the fence* (2026-09-27, chain `codingsession`, `docs/CODINGSESSION-PLAN-2026-09-27.md`). The secretary only PROPOSES one (`propose_coding_session`, a `Task`: plain text, ≤ 4 KB, parsed once); `Act::CodingSession` is performed by the tap alone, through the act performer (`commands::coding::Coder`, in no record), which fires the ONE routine `[coding]` names with the task and nothing else. The session runs in the cloud with no route to the tailnet; what it may do is the routine\'s saved prompt (`docs/CODINGSESSION-ROUTINE.md`, versioned here, pasted once), and the payload arrives as untrusted data. `SUZATARY_ROUTINE_TOKEN` is read from secretspec per fire and set from Settings, never a chat. A session\'s life is the closed `coding::Session`, stepped only by `Session::step`; the poll reads `claude/` branches for a report naming the session\'s URL and never runs their code. The box never merges, builds or promotes a cloud branch: the session\'s pull request is the hand-over, the train records the todo its `Completes:` line names as done, and `scripts/deploy.sh` stays the only deploy. "Build it" on an open todo of the chain `app/core/releases.toml` names files the same card, serving the todo, its task the todo\'s stored text, its attempt and its id for `Completes:` (`secretary::build`). The filing door (`filed::file_held`, under the inbox\'s hold) refuses a coding session serving a todo while that todo or two others are in progress, whoever files it: an open todo is in progress while a card serving it is open or its session is fired or reported.', rationale='Decided 2026-09-27 (chain codingsession, docs/CODINGSESSION-PLAN-2026-09-27.md). Revised 2026-10-28 by stage 1 of docs/SHAREDPRODROME-PLAN-2026-10-25.md: the session\'s pull request already hands the branch to the main session, so "Hand to the main session" and its merge todo went, and a session can start from a todo of the project\'s list, at most two in progress.', supersedes=()))